@Comment:	a rushed but enthusiastic mealtime , about 9 minutes long; Chi , SIS , and Mot seem to get along pretty nicely; Sis gives narrative and a sort of fantasy play , pretending to be an answering machine message; there's a lot of politeness talk (also some teasing); song sung by everyone at end; then Chi sings again (of course); one noteable thing is the number of other people mentioned; this is NOT an isolated family
